          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nimport math\n#0(n)\ndef ngto1(n):\n    for i in range(2, n):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return n > 1\n\n#0(sqrt(n))\ndef ngto2(n):\n    for i in range(2, math.isqrt(n) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return n > 1\n```",
